%% Figure 11 — Caller-only My Notifications Inbox
flowchart LR
  User([Signed-in IDTS user]) --> Bell[Fiori notification bell\nand caller unread badge]
  Bell --> Open[Open responsive inbox]
  Open --> Call[NotificationService operations]
  Call --> Identity{Exactly one active internal user\nand aligned business role?}
  Identity -- No --> Denied[403 safe response\nNo inbox disclosure]
  Identity -- Yes --> Scope[Apply recipient scope before\nfilter, order, paging or mutation]
  Scope --> Search[Search bounded page\nAll / Bug / Access\nAll / Unread / Read]
  Search --> Sources[(Hydrate allowlisted Bug notification\nor material access-audit source)]
  Sources --> DTO[Return safe DTO in stable server order\n25 rows with Load More]
  DTO --> List[Display title, summary, time,\nunread and action-required state]

  List --> Choice{User action}
  Choice -- Select item --> Mark[Attempt idempotent optimistic mark-read\nFailure does not block a safe target]
  Mark --> Target{Stored target matches\nallowlisted same-origin route?}
  Target -- Yes --> Navigate[Open active Bug or safe landing route]
  Target -- No --> Stay[Keep inbox open\nDo not navigate]
  Choice -- Mark all read --> Snapshot[Mark caller-owned unread rows\nat or before UI snapshot]
  Choice -- Load more or filter --> Search
  Snapshot --> Refresh[Refresh list and unread badge]
  Navigate --> Refresh
  Stay --> Refresh

  classDef action fill:#eef5ff,stroke:#2b88d9,color:#172b4d;
  classDef decision fill:#f2edff,stroke:#7f65c5,color:#172b4d;
  classDef storage fill:#ecf8f1,stroke:#398b63,color:#172b4d;
  classDef deny fill:#fff0f0,stroke:#c65353,color:#7a1e1e;
  class User,Bell,Open,Call,Scope,Search,DTO,List,Mark,Navigate,Stay,Snapshot,Refresh action;
  class Identity,Choice,Target decision;
  class Sources storage;
  class Denied deny;
